<div class="list-pages-item">


<div class="content-panel standalone series">
<div style="text-align: right;">
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;评分</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;评分</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/short-stories:00014/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>███/██/██ ██:██, 地点：不曾圆满的家</p>
<hr />
<p>“Crenshall，给老子深深的反省。”</p>
<p>“对不起，我不该让这些混蛋思绪充盈在脑中&#8230;&#8230;”</p>
<p>“你就该去死。”</p>
<p>“我说了抱歉！我没有想到这个<a href="/scp-3041">混账东西</a>能带来此般后果！我说我很抱歉！”</p>
<p>“是吗？晚了！”</p>
<p>带着恨与悔，凶手倒在了镜子前、血池中。</p>
<hr />
