<p><span id="u-credit-00019" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/short-stories:00019" target="_blank">编辑 &amp; 评论</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00019-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/merle-teary" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6444174); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6444174&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610076222" alt="Merle Teary" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6444174)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/merle-teary" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6444174); return false;">Merle Teary</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1591425818 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">06 Jun 2020 06:43</span></p>
</div>
