<p>20██/██/██ ██:██, 地点：HMCL会议室</p>
<hr />
<p>关于改进代号“兽-18”未编号异常生物收容措施：</p>
<ul>
<li>每隔12日投放：
<ul>
<li>8~16岁女性x1</li>
<li><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">未满5月的婴儿x2</span></li>
<li>铅 5kg</li>
<li>汞 20L</li>
<li>活体驴x1</li>
<li>伐地那非x6.9kg</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
<h3><span><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;&#32;</span><span style="border:1px solid #b01;padding:1%"><span style="color: #b01">否 决</span></span></span></h3>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p>婴儿需尽量用于<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-2845">SCP-2845</a>的收容，应加快寻找替代方案————Dr.████</p>
</div>
<hr />
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;评论区&nbsp;1个</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;评论区</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4055881); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4055881&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1610076223" alt="Etinjat" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4055881)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/etinjat" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4055881); return false;">Etinjat</a></span>：</strong>从归档处转来</p>
</blockquote>
